---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer - YTools"
  description="YTools disclaimer, terms of use, and limitations of liability."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 w-full">
    <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 space-y-6 text-text-main">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Last updated: {new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}</p>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. No Affiliation</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          YTools is an independent service and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by YouTube,
          Google LLC, or any other third-party platform. All product names, logos, and brands are property of
          their respective owners.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Lawful Use Only</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Our tools are provided for personal, lawful use only. You are solely responsible for ensuring that
          you have the necessary rights and permissions before converting, extracting, or downloading any
          content. Unauthorized downloading or reproduction of copyrighted material may violate the terms of
          service of the source platform and applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. No Warranty</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          The services are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind,
          either express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for
          a particular purpose, or non-infringement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, YTools shall not be liable for any direct, indirect,
          incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of your use of, or inability to use,
          the services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Copyright</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          We respect the intellectual property of others. If you believe your copyrighted work has been
          infringed, please review our <a href="/dmca" class="text-primary-500 hover:underline">DMCA Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="text-xs text-text-muted border-t border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 pt-4">
        This disclaimer is provided as a general template and does not constitute legal advice. Please review
        it with a qualified attorney to ensure it meets your specific obligations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
